;\">Five Hundred Kwacha &middot; Águila Pescadora Africana &middot; Recolectores de Algodón</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"zambia-500-kwacha\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 500 Kwacha\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-500-kwacha-2003-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-500-kwacha-2003-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 500 Kwacha de polímero del Bank of Zambia, anverso arriba con águila pescadora africana y árbol baobab, reverso abajo con recolectores de algodón, un elefante y la Estatua de la Libertad de Zambia\" width=\"564\" height=\"559\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Quinientos Kwacha</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Canadian Bank Note Company (CBN)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha de Emisión</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2003</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmante</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Caleb Fundanga (Governor)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">140 &times; 70 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-43a</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> águila pescadora africana (<em>Haliaeetus vocifer</em>), ave nacional de Zambia, posada en una rama; al centro, un árbol baobab; a la izquierda, el medallón con el monograma &ldquo;BOZ&rdquo;.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> recolectores trabajando en campos de algodón; a la izquierda, la cabeza de un elefante africano; a la derecha, la Estatua de la Libertad de Zambia (Chainbreaker), en Lusaka.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana en forma de paloma:</strong> gran apertura transparente con la silueta de una paloma de la paz en vuelo, en relieve óptico mate.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> marrón, ocre, naranja y subtonos verde oliva.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:64px auto; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.16);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ 1000 KWACHA ============ -->\n      <section style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 32px;\">\n          <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); line-height:1.1; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 10px;\">1.000 Kwacha &middot; 2003</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">One Thousand Kwacha &middot; Águila Pescadora Africana &middot; Mecanización Agrícola</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"zambia-1000-kwacha\" aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de 1.000 Kwacha\" style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-1000-kwacha-2003-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img src=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-1000-kwacha-2003-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 1.000 Kwacha de polímero del Bank of Zambia, anverso arriba con águila pescadora africana y árbol baobab, reverso abajo con un agricultor en tractor, un aardvark y la Estatua de la Libertad de Zambia\" width=\"564\" height=\"562\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\" />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Mil Kwacha</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Polímero puro &mdash; sustrato Guardian&reg;</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Canadian Bank Note Company (CBN)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha de Emisión</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">2003</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmante</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Caleb Fundanga (Governor)</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensiones</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">140 &times; 70 mm</span></div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span><span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-44a</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Contexto Histórico y de Emisión</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Pioneros del continente:</strong> en 2003, Zambia se convirtió en el primer país de África en emitir billetes de polímero; los de 500 y 1.000 Kwacha de esta ficha comparten esa distinción histórica.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1,2</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Un lanzamiento accidentado:</strong> los primeros ejemplares se retiraron un día después de su liberación, ya que su número de serie podía borrarse con facilidad; una segunda emisión con la misma fecha pero una nueva fórmula de tinta comenzó a circular en noviembre de 2003.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup> Más tarde se descubrió que estos billetes se decoloraban antes de lo esperado, y la imprenta debió asumir el costo del reemplazo.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Retirados en la redenominación de 2013:</strong> tras la reforma monetaria de 2012&ndash;2013, que eliminó tres ceros de la moneda, estos billetes de polímero fueron retirados de circulación &mdash;el de 1.000 Kwacha reemplazado por una moneda de 1 Kwacha, y el de 500 Kwacha por una de 50 Ngwee&mdash; y la nueva serie regular volvió al papel.<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1,2</sup></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave Visibles en el Billete</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Anverso:</strong> misma composición de águila pescadora y árbol baobab; a la izquierda, el sello nacional &ldquo;ZAMBIA 2003&rdquo; junto al medallón guilloché con el logotipo &ldquo;BOZ&rdquo;.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> un agricultor conduciendo un tractor en un campo de maíz; a la izquierda, el retrato de un aardvark o cerdo hormiguero africano (<em>Orycteropus afer</em>); a la derecha, la Estatua de la Libertad de Zambia.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Ventana transparente con silueta:</strong> apertura con contorno de una paloma en vuelo, en relieve mate, lisa al tacto.</span></li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\"><span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Colorido:</strong> rojo carmín, rosa, verde y amarillo multicolor.</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:44px auto 0; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notas</h2>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Wikipedia, &ldquo;Zambian kwacha&rdquo;: &ldquo;In 2003, Zambia became the first African country to issue polymer banknotes. The 500 and 1000 kwacha were both printed on polymer.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. The Zambian Observer, &ldquo;The Period When Zambia Introduced Polymer Bank Notes&rdquo;: &ldquo;In the year 2003, Zambia became the first country in Africa to issue polymer bank notes&hellip; The contract to print the notes was won by the Canadian Banknote Company.&rdquo;</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">3. Banknote World, &ldquo;Zambia Kwacha Banknote History&rdquo;: &ldquo;these notes were immediately withdrawn the day after they were initially released since their serial number can be wiped out easily. In November 2003 new issues bearing the same date but using a new ink formula begin to circulate&hellip; these new polymer notes fade earlier than expected, causing the printer to shoulder the cost of replacement.&rdquo;</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\" style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n      <button data-zoom-close aria-label=\"Cerrar\" style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\">&times;</button>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button disabled=\"false\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\">\n        \n          <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-500-kwacha-2003-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n            <img src=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-500-kwacha-2003-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 500 Kwacha de Zambia, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" />\n          </picture>\n        \n        \n          <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-1000-kwacha-2003-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n            <img src=\"uploads/zambia-bank-of-zambia-1000-kwacha-2003-polimero.jpg\" alt=\"Billete de 1.000 Kwacha de Zambia, vista ampliada\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\" />\n          </picture>\n        \n      </div>\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
